; expect 47
; A macro invoked by its QUALIFIED name - `QualMac::qdbl` - and a
; zero-parameter one referenced bare-qualified, `QualMac::qfive`
; (MAC-LANG-3's other spelling, through MAC-LANG-12's split). Until
; 2026-08-14 both were `AX3001 undefined variable QualMac::qdbl`:
; the parser flattens a qualified reference to `QualMac$qdbl`, macro
; declarations keep bare names, and nothing split the reference.
; docs/macro-system.md MAC-LANG-12.
(import QualMac)

(:: main Int)

(fn (main)
  (+
    (QualMac::qdbl
      21
    )    QualMac::qfive
  )
)
